<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Where to Start | Arrington Consultancy</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Choose how to start with Arrington Consultancy, from a free conversation through to a £3,400 Commercial Review plus Website Build package.">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/where-to-start">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Where to Start | Arrington Consultancy">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Choose how to start with Arrington Consultancy, what each option costs, and what happens next.">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/where-to-start">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/img/logo">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Where to Start | Arrington Consultancy">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Choose how to start with Arrington Consultancy, what each option costs, and what happens next.">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/img/logo">
    <meta name="csrf-token" content="<%= csrfToken %>">
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icons/icon-32.png" type="image/png" sizes="32x32">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icons/icon-16.png" type="image/png" sizes="16x16">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=AW-18129914078"></script>
    <script nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
        function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
        gtag('js', new Date());
        gtag('config', 'AW-18129914078');
        <% if (ga4Id) { %>
        gtag('config', '<%= ga4Id %>');
        <% } %>
    </script>
    <style nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        :root {
            <% for (const [prop, val] of Object.entries(theme.vars)) { %>
            <%= prop %>: <%= val %>;
            <% } %>
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            background: var(--black);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        <%- include('partials/site-chrome-styles') %>

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: var(--text-bright);
            line-height: 1.18;
            margin: 0;
        }
        p { color: var(--text); margin: 0; }

        .wts-label {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
            display: block;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            max-width: 100%;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.55rem 1.35rem;
            border-radius: 3px;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: var(--black); border-color: var(--accent); }
        .btn-primary:hover, .btn-primary:focus-visible { background: var(--accent-hover); border-color: var(--accent-hover); }
        .btn-outline { background: transparent; color: var(--text-bright); border-color: var(--border); }
        .btn-outline:hover, .btn-outline:focus-visible { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

        /* Intro — deliberately tight. This page's job is to be understood in
           seconds, not to build atmosphere before it gets to the point. */
        .wts-intro {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 7.5rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
        }
        .wts-intro h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.7rem); margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
        .wts-intro p { font-size: 1.08rem; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 560px; }

        main { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem 5rem; }

        /* One continuous route, cheapest to most involved. No price cards,
           no badges, no shop layout. */
        .wts-path {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .wts-step {
            position: relative;
            padding: 3rem 0 3rem 4.75rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .wts-step-marker {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 2.6rem;
            font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
            font-size: 3.2rem;
            line-height: 1;
            color: var(--accent);
            opacity: 0.22;
            user-select: none;
        }
        .wts-step-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            column-gap: 1.25rem;
            row-gap: 0.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        }
        .wts-step-head h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; }
        .wts-step-price {
            margin-left: auto;
            font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
            font-size: 2.1rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .wts-step-kicker {
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-style: italic;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .wts-step-body {
            font-size: 1.02rem;
            max-width: 560px;
            margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
        }
        .wts-step-body strong { color: var(--text-bright); font-weight: 600; }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .wts-step { padding-left: 0; padding-top: 3.4rem; }
            .wts-step-marker { position: static; display: block; font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
        }

        /* Closing line only, no fanfare. */
        .wts-else {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3.5rem 0 0.5rem;
        }
        .wts-else p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/site-header', { currentPage: { slug: 'where-to-start' }, navPages, canEdit: false, content, pageContact }) %>

    <div class="wts-intro">
        <p class="wts-label">Where to Start</p>
        <h1>Choose the way in.</h1>
        <p>Start with a conversation, or buy the piece of work that already fits.</p>
    </div>

    <main>
        <div class="wts-path">
            <section class="wts-step" id="conversation-offer">
                <span class="wts-step-marker" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
                <div class="wts-step-head">
                    <h2>30 Minute Conversation</h2>
                    <p class="wts-step-price">£0</p>
                </div>
                <p class="wts-step-kicker">If the right move is not obvious, start here.</p>
                <p class="wts-step-body">A direct conversation about what is happening in the business, where time is being lost, and whether there is a real piece of work worth doing. If there is not, we will say so.</p>
                <a href="#conversation" class="btn btn-primary">Start the conversation</a>
            </section>

            <section class="wts-step" id="commercial-review-offer">
                <span class="wts-step-marker" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
                <div class="wts-step-head">
                    <h2><%= offers.commercial_review.name %></h2>
                    <p class="wts-step-price">£<%= (offers.commercial_review.pricePence / 100).toLocaleString('en-GB') %></p>
                </div>
                <p class="wts-step-kicker">A clear commercial read on where the next edge may be.</p>
                <p class="wts-step-body">We listen carefully, then give you a written assessment, recommendations and what to do first. Useful when the business has become richer, sharper or more capable than the website, offer or day-to-day operation currently shows. Delivered within 4 business days. <strong>Fully credited</strong> if you go on to either bigger review route.</p>
                <a href="/where-to-start/commercial-review" class="btn btn-primary">Start your Commercial Review</a>
            </section>

            <section class="wts-step" id="website-build-offer">
                <span class="wts-step-marker" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
                <div class="wts-step-head">
                    <h2><%= offers.website_build.name %></h2>
                    <p class="wts-step-price">£<%= (offers.website_build.pricePence / 100).toLocaleString('en-GB') %></p>
                </div>
                <p class="wts-step-kicker">More than pages. A coded website that can start doing useful work.</p>
                <p class="wts-step-body">A fixed-price build for businesses that are ready for more than a template. The site can include enquiry flows, payments, API integrations, CRM-style tracking or an AI assistant trained around your business, where that will save time or help win the right work.</p>
                <a href="/where-to-start/website-build" class="btn btn-primary">Start your Website Build</a>
            </section>

            <section class="wts-step" id="full-review-offer">
                <span class="wts-step-marker" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
                <div class="wts-step-head">
                    <h2><%= offers.full_commercial_review.name %></h2>
                    <p class="wts-step-price">£<%= (offers.full_commercial_review.pricePence / 100).toLocaleString('en-GB') %></p>
                </div>
                <p class="wts-step-kicker">For owners who want the thinking turned into practical change.</p>
                <p class="wts-step-body">The review goes deeper, then we stay involved while the right changes are shaped and started. For businesses that have already built something worth protecting and now need the next stage made easier to run: clearer decisions, follow-up that matches the standard of the business, systems around what already works and less work sitting with the owner. Completed within 4 weeks.</p>
                <a href="/where-to-start/full-commercial-review" class="btn btn-primary">Start review and implementation</a>
            </section>

            <section class="wts-step" id="full-package-offer">
                <span class="wts-step-marker" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
                <div class="wts-step-head">
                    <h2><%= offers.full_review_website_build.name %></h2>
                    <p class="wts-step-price">£<%= (offers.full_review_website_build.pricePence / 100).toLocaleString('en-GB') %></p>
                </div>
                <p class="wts-step-kicker">For a business that has outgrown how it presents itself.</p>
                <p class="wts-step-body">We review the business internally, then build the website around what it has become. That can mean clearer positioning, stronger enquiry handling, AI support, integrations and a site that helps move the business forward within days, not years.</p>
                <a href="/where-to-start/full-review-website-build" class="btn btn-primary">Start review and website build</a>
            </section>
        </div>

        <section class="wts-else" id="something-else-offer">
            <p>Something else? Tell us what is going on and we will tell you honestly whether we can help.</p>
            <a href="#conversation" class="btn btn-outline">Tell us what you need</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/site-footer', { canEdit: false, pageContact, content }) %>
    <script nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        <%- include('partials/site-chrome-script') %>
    </script>
</body>
</html>
